---
import ImagePlaceholder from "@/components/ui/ImagePlaceholder.astro";
import chemistry from "@/assets/chemistry.jpg";
import smellGood from "@/assets/smell-good.jpg";
import thingsGetCloser from "@/assets/things-get-closer.jpg";

const row = "grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))] items-center gap-[clamp(20px,3vw,40px)] border-t-2 border-dashed border-white/20 pt-[clamp(24px,3vw,40px)]";
const number = "text-[clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem)] leading-[0.75] font-black text-pink stretch-wide";
const title = "mt-[18px] text-[clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3rem)] leading-[0.95] font-black uppercase stretch-hero";
const body = "mt-3.5 max-w-[38ch] text-xl leading-normal";
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="on-dark section-px section-py overflow-hidden bg-charcoal text-white">
  <div class="container-lg">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <h2 class="display-word text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[0.88] text-pink stretch-display">How it works</h2>
      <p class="max-w-[34ch] text-xl leading-[1.4]" data-copy-review="body-taste claim">
        <strong>Body taste is biochemistry — and it's fixable.</strong>
        <br />
        <span class="text-base">
          Subscribe to our Pre-Launch List and we'll send you the <strong>"Body Taste Cheat Code Guide"</strong> as PDF.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="mt-[clamp(40px,5vw,72px)] grid gap-[clamp(20px,3vw,32px)]">
      <li class:list={[row]}>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[number]}>
              {" "}
              01{" "}
            </span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-3.5 animate-[sg-blink_1.6s_ease-in-out_infinite] rounded-full bg-pink"></span>
          </div>
          <h3 class:list={[title]}>First, you have to smell good</h3>
          <p class:list={[body]} data-copy-review="body-odor claim">
            You know the saying: <strong>you have to like someone’s smell</strong>. Your natural scent is shaped by what you eat, how your body metabolizes it and what your body naturally produces.
            <strong>Snugglegum™ works from within — not to cover you up, but to help you smell a little more inviting</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-rotate-1 bg-pink rounded-3xl">
          <ImagePlaceholder src={smellGood} alt="Illustration of a couple: one recoils, annoyed, while the other looks on, confused" />
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class:list={[row]}>
        <div class="order-1 sm:order-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[number]}>
              {" "}
              02{" "}
            </span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-6">
              <span class="absolute inset-0 animate-[sg-burst_1.8s_ease-out_infinite] rounded-full border-2 border-pink"></span>
              <span class="absolute inset-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class:list={[title]}>Then things get closer</h3>
          <p class:list={[body]} data-copy-review="ingredient benefit claim">
            Perfume stays on your skin. <strong>You don’t</strong>. Breath, sweat, saliva — and the other fluids involved when things get really close — all have their own chemistry.
            <strong>Snugglegum™ is made for what happens beyond the bottle of perfume</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="order-2 sm:order-1 aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-rotate-1 bg-pink rounded-3xl">
          <ImagePlaceholder src={thingsGetCloser} alt="Illustration of a couple embracing closely, hearts floating around them" />
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class:list={[row]}>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[number]}>
              {" "}
              03{" "}
            </span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-6">
              <span class="absolute inset-0 animate-[sg-burst_1.8s_ease-out_infinite] rounded-full border-2 border-pink"></span>
              <span class="absolute inset-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class:list={[title]}>Feed the chemistry</h3>
          <p class:list={[body]}>
            Snugglegum™ doesn’t replace a balanced diet. But let’s be honest: sometimes dinner is healthy. <strong>Sometimes it’s fries. Sometimes it’s just coffee.</strong>
            Zinc and the other ingredients in the formula provide nutritional support for processes your body already relies on.
            <strong>Think of it as a little backup for your everyday chemistry</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-rotate-1 bg-pink rounded-3xl">
          <ImagePlaceholder src={chemistry} alt="Illustration of a scientist in a lab coat holding two test tubes, surrounded by molecule diagrams" />
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
